      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Inter-Lead Attention & Native XAI",
      "items": [
        "MultiheadAttention 4 head (d_model=128) memodelkan korelasi elektrofisiologis spasial",
        "Matriks atensi [12, 12] native XAI mengungkap kopling timbal balik antar-lead",
        "Residual connection + LayerNorm menjaga stabilitas representasi sebelum pooling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Imbalance Handling (ASL)",
      "items": [
        "Asymmetric Loss (γ_neg=4, γ_pos=1, clip=0.05) mendiskon negatif mudah",
        "Mengatasi ketimpangan ekstrem 34:1 untuk 6 kelas diagnostik (NORM, AFIB, CLBBB, 1AVB, SBRAD, STACH)",
